  "$id": "payroll-framework-pack.v1",
  "title": "Payroll legal framework pack, version 1 (PLAN-54)",
  "description": "The legal pack of a payroll framework version. Every value that governs pay carries its legal reference, its status (Signed or Interim) and, when interim, the STR-002 exception that allows it. The importer (PayrollFrameworkPackValidator) enforces this contract in code; the unit test Pay054FrameworkPackImporterTests keeps this file and the importer in line. Rules a schema cannot say: tax brackets ascend with no gap and the last has the open-ended limit 9999999999999999.99; codes, categories, decision ids and holiday dates are unique; every decision a value cites exists in decisions[] or in the agency register after the import.",
